{"title":"Glimmerfox Feet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Leatherworking Lv 46) · Monster drop: Young Red Dragon, Fledgling Harpy, Ogre Charger</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Leatherworking at level 46 <span class=\"muted\">(2344 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/glimmerfox-pelt\">Glimmerfox Pelt</a>, 4× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"fledgling-harpy\" title=\"Fledgling Harpy - dropped it in 1 of 65 looted corpses (1/65)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/5e20684bb6f8862fa4e7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fledgling Harpy</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/65<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 431 looted corpses (1/431)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/431<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 1,131 looted corpses (1/1,131)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,131<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"glimmerfox-feet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n  